{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2023-02-13 16:02:00', 'title': "NEW JERSEY AMERICAN WATER TO ADD LEAD SERVICE LINE REPLACEMENT CHARGE TO CUSTOMERS' BILLS BEGINNING FEBRUARY 13, 2023", 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NEW JERSEY AMERICAN WATER IS SCHEDULED TO BEGIN IMPLEMENTING ITS FIRST LEAD SERVICE LINE REPLACEMENT (LSLR) CHARGE FOR ALL WATER AND FIRE SERVICE CUSTOMERS STATEWIDE BEGINNING FEBRUARY 13, 2023, UNDER A NEW LSLR SURCHARGE MECHANISM APPROVED BY THE NJ BOARD OF PUBLIC UTILITIES (NJ BPU) IN 2022. THE LSLR SURCHARGE IS TO RECOVER $7.'}